    {"id": "K11", "group": "K", "cls": "testable", "consequence": "Light at the bed = f(Kd, depth), and the product is rarely formed", "blocker": "**Both halves held**: `lys` {fig:da_lys_rows} rows and bottom depth in `maaledybde`, {fig:da_light_paired} paired. Carries the Kd start-depth artefact, and Secchi censoring at the bed: {fig:da_secchi_shallow_pct}% of paired readings in water shallower than {fig:da_secchi_shallow_to} m reach the bed"},
    {"id": "K12", "group": "K", "cls": "fetch", "consequence": "Structure removal -> habitat loss independent of water quality", "blocker": "stone extraction records, reef restoration locations and dates"},
    {"id": "K13", "group": "K", "cls": "unscoreable", "consequence": "Particle spectra shift below the filter-feeder window", "blocker": "**Particle size spectra and larval condition indices are not monitored**"},
    {"id": "K14", "group": "K", "cls": "fetch", "consequence": "Functional diversity falls before species richness does", "blocker": "ODA bundfauna `Emne_3_180`"},
    {"id": "W1", "group": "W", "cls": "resolution", "consequence": "Recovery fails where propagule supply is cut", "blocker": "source populations plus particle tracking; the held circulation model is {was:4469fc7:docs/hypodrafts/TRIAGE.md:circulation model is @@ and ~2x slow} and {was:4469fc7:docs/hypodrafts/TRIAGE.md:km and @@ in the straits} in the straits"},
    {"id": "W2", "group": "W", "cls": "experiment", "consequence": "Unconditioned substrate fails to recruit", "blocker": "**settlement plates with and without conditioning.** Cheap, and connects to the sediment-inoculation experiment `X1`"},
    {"id": "W3", "group": "W", "cls": "resolution", "consequence": "Bloom and larval peak drift apart", "blocker": "**sub-monthly plankton series.** The register itself states sampling frequency is the binding constraint, not the parameters"},
    {"id": "W4", "group": "W", "cls": "fetch", "consequence": "Below a density threshold reproduction fails", "blocker": "ODA bundfauna carries densities; the analysis is then a desk exercise"},
    {"id": "W5", "group": "W", "cls": "fetch", "consequence": "Disturbance interval shorter than recovery time", "blocker": "**trawling effort at monthly or finer.** The ICES/HELCOM layer is quarterly; finer is the closed dataset"},
    {"id": "W6", "group": "W", "cls": "testable", "consequence": "Rate of change exceeds acclimation rate", "blocker": "**high-frequency records exist and are analysed for means rather than rates.** The CTD record supports a rate analysis now"},
    {"id": "W8", "group": "W", "cls": "experiment", "consequence": "The founder community determines the endpoint", "blocker": "composition immediately after disturbance and through recovery at the same place — requires having sampled before"},
    {"id": "W7", "group": "W", "cls": "fetch", "consequence": "Too little standing variation is left to respond with", "blocker": "long species-level fauna is in ODA; **genetic data nobody has**, so that half is unscoreable"},
    {"id": "Z1", "group": "Z", "cls": "testable", "consequence": "Light at the bed outside the window -> loss", "blocker": "the same product as {ref:K11}; both halves held"},
    {"id": "Z2", "group": "Z", "cls": "resolution", "consequence": "Browning shifts the spectrum, not just the quantity", "blocker": "**Kd is a single broadband number.** FDOM ({fig:da_fdom_rows} rows, from {fig:da_fdom_first} onward only) is a CDOM proxy on the same cast — {calc:da_fdom_last - da_fdom_first + 1|.0f} years of in-situ CDOM"},
    {"id": "Z3", "group": "Z", "cls": "unscoreable", "consequence": "Photoperiod cue decouples from temperature cue", "blocker": "**Effectively no phenological observations for Danish marine invertebrates**"},
    {"id": "Z4", "group": "Z", "cls": "resolution", "consequence": "Rate of temperature change, not level, exceeds tolerance", "blocker": "bottom temperature at high frequency; the monthly product aliases it, the raw record may not"},
    {"id": "Z5", "group": "Z", "cls": "testable", "consequence": "Energy has a floor — too still is also a failure", "blocker": "bed shear already computed here from {fig:da_wind_years} years of wind; the floor is testable against the same state variables"},
    {"id": "Z6", "group": "Z", "cls": "unscoreable", "consequence": "Sound masks settlement cues", "blocker": "**essentially no noise measurement tied to invertebrate settlement**"},
    {"id": "Z7", "group": "Z", "cls": "resolution", "consequence": "EMF from cables alters behaviour", "blocker": "cable routes and energisation dates are available; **biological response is not measured**"},
    {"id": "Z8", "group": "Z", "cls": "testable", "consequence": "The attenuation budget is never partitioned", "blocker": "**Draft exists** (`hypodrafts/Z8.md`). Kd plus chlorophyll, CDOM and particle proxies on the same cast, {was:4469fc7:docs/hypodrafts/TRIAGE.md:same cast, @@ — but} — but `Lysdaempning` has no path length, so it is a variance apportionment, not a budget"},
    {"id": "Z9", "group": "Z", "cls": "fetch", "consequence": "Epiphytes shade the plant regardless of water clarity", "blocker": "epiphyte biomass on eelgrass — in research programmes, not routine monitoring"},
    {"id": "Z10", "group": "Z", "cls": "fetch", "consequence": "Works plumes exceed natural turbidity long enough to matter", "blocker": "works chronology plus the turbidity monitoring large projects must do and rarely reanalyse"},
    {"id": "Z11", "group": "Z", "cls": "experiment", "consequence": "A weakened host fails at a stress a healthy one survives", "blocker": "carbohydrate reserves, tissue sulphide and pathogen load on the same plants"},
