    {"id": "L3", "group": "L", "cls": "testable", "consequence": "The trend depends on the start year", "blocker": "**Draft exists and was run** (`hypodrafts/L3.md`). {was:4469fc7:docs/hypodrafts/TRIAGE.md:was run** (`hypodrafts/L3.md`). @@, so L3's}, so {ref:L3}'s strong reading is **not established** for bed oxygen"},
    {"id": "L4", "group": "L", "cls": "fetch", "consequence": "Recovery is blocked by something other than the driver", "blocker": "restoration trials with controls — a handful exist in Denmark and are not treated as decisive"},
