    {"id": "I1", "group": "I", "cls": "testable", "consequence": "Apparent change concentrates where the network changed", "blocker": "**Draft exists** (`hypodrafts/I1.md`). {was:4469fc7:docs/hypodrafts/TRIAGE.md:exists** (`hypodrafts/I1.md`). @@. The}. The register cannot supply lifespans; presence comes from the observation record"},
    {"id": "I2", "group": "I", "cls": "resolution", "consequence": "Step changes at probe changeover, shared across geography", "blocker": "**`SondeNr` is `999` on {calc@K-SUBSET-SHARE:da_probe999 / da_ctd_rows * 100|.1f}% of rows** in the whole CTD extract. The rest carries {fig:da_real_probes} identified probes and is where {ref:I2} is testable"},
    {"id": "I3", "group": "I", "cls": "testable", "consequence": "Apparent severity scales with visit count and window", "blocker": "**Draft exists** (`hypodrafts/I3.md`). The count-and-window half is fully testable; **the diel half is carved out as `class 6`, unscoreable**"},
